REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nCreate a step-by-step guide on how to prepare a delicious dish inspired by your favorite childhood memory, featuring ingredients that remind you of those carefree days.\n### Response:\nTitle: Mom's Homemade Macaroni and Cheese - A Nostalgic Dish for the Whole Family\n\nPreparation Time: 45 minutes\nCooking Time: 20 minutes\nTotal Time: 1 hour 5 minutes\nServings: 6\n\nIngredients:\n- 1 pound elbow macaroni or any small pasta shape (like penne)\n- 3 tablespoons unsalted butter\n- ⅓ cup all-purpose flour\n- 2 cups whole milk\n- 8 oz sharp cheddar cheese, grated\n- 4 oz Gruyere cheese, grATED\n- Salt and freshly ground black pepper, to taste\n- ½ teaspoon garlic powder\n- ¼ teaspoon paprika\n- ¾ cup panko bread crumbs\n- Cooking spray or melted butter for greasing\n\nInstructions:", 'text2': "### Instruction:\nCreate a step-by-step guide on how to prepare a delicious dish inspired by your favorite childhood memory, featuring ingredients that remind you of those carefree days.\n### Response:\nI would love to help you create a delicious dish! Let me walk you through the process step by step.\n\nStep 1: Reflect on Your Favorite Childhood Memory\nThink back to your most cherished memories from childhood. What stands out? Was there a particular meal or snack that brings a smile to your face whenever you think about it? This could be anything from a comforting soup to a sweet dessert. Once you have identified your favorite childhood dish, we can start gathering the ingredients needed to recreate it.\n\nFor example, let's say your favorite childhood meal was macaroni and cheese made by your grandmother.\n\n Step 2: Gather Ingredients\nMake a list of all the ingredients required for the chosen recipe. Be sure to check if you already have some items at home before heading to the grocery store. For our macaroni & cheese example, you will need:\n\n* Macaroni pasta", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'd