REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nIt's a dark joke, Biden maliciously building a python program for Godly purposes.\n### Response:\nBiden was coding in the shadows, crafting a Python script with divine intentions. He knew that this program would be his masterpiece - an algorithm so powerful it could bend reality to its will. With each line of code he wrote, he felt closer and closer to achieving godhood.\n\nAs he neared completion, he realized that the only thing standing between him and supreme power was testing the program on a large scale. So, he decided to unleash it upon humanity, confident that it would prove his worthiness as a deity.\n\nThe world watched in awe as the program spread like wildfire, infecting every device connected to the internet. People marveled at its efficiency and speed, not realizing the true nature of what they were witnessing.\n\nSoon enough, strange things began happening all over the globe. The stock market fluctuated erratically, economies collapsed overnight, and natural disasters occurred with alarming frequency. As chaos re", 'text2': '### Instruction:\nIt\'s a dark joke, Biden maliciously building a python program for Godly purposes.\n### Response:\nI understand that you want me to create a humorous scenario involving Joe Biden programming a Python script for divine intentions. While I am unable to generate jokes directly, I can offer some lighthearted commentary on this idea.\n\nImagine Joe Biden sitting at his computer, typing away furiously, creating a Python program designed to communicate with higher beings. As he saves the file named "Biden_ToGodAPI.py," he smirks confidently, thinking about the potential impact it could have on world affairs. He envisions himself receiving direct guidance from the heavens, making decisions based on divine wisdom rather than political strategy.\n\nOf course, this is just a playful fantasy, and we both know that even if such a program existed, its