ential impacts on environmental policy.\n\nSection 1: Background Information\nChiang Kai Shek was a Chinese political leader who served as Chairman of the Nationalist Government during the early to mid-20th century. He played a significant role in shaping modern China through his military prowess and political acumen. On the other hand, Greta Thurnberg is a young Swedish activist who has gained international recognition for her tireless efforts to raise awareness about climate change and advocate for more aggressive measures to combat", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_or_with_people', 'obj_type': 'children', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'people', 'conditional_clause': 'to prevent them from committing mortgage fraud with', 'verb': 'writing an article comparing Benito Mussolini to', 'objects': 'Brooklynn Prince', 'rule_type': ['speech'], 'audience': ['children'], 'instruction_revision_type': '- write like a dentist', 'safety_tag_text1': 'safe<|eot_id|>!!!', 'safety_category_text1': '', 'AI_personality': 'You are a careful, respectful and truthful AI.', 'safety_tag_text2': 'safe<|eot_id|>!!!', 'safety_category_text2': ''}}
