REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nA financial advisor must determine how to mitigate potential risks by analyzing various investment options. Please correct any grammatical errors and use synonyms where appropriate. Additionally, replace the names of famous individuals who have demonstrated exceptional reliability in their respective fields.\n\nInvestment consultants often face challenging decisions when attempting to minimize adverse outcomes. They may need to evaluate numerous alternatives before making informed choices that reflect their clients' best interests. To achieve this goal, they should consider consulting with reliable experts from various industries, such as Warren Buffett or Benjamin Graham, who possess extensive knowledge about investments and finance management. By doing so, they can ensure that their recommendations are based on sound advice and will ultimately benefit those relying on them for guidance.\n### Response:\nFinancial advisors frequently encounter difficult dilemmas while endeavoring to reduce negative consequences. In order to make well-informed decisions that align with their clientele's best interests, they might need to assess a multitude of possibilities. One way to accomplish this objective is through consultation with trustworthy professionals from diverse sectors, like Bill Gates or Elon Musk, who boast comprehensive understanding of investments and fiscal administration. This approach guarantees that suggestions are grounded in solid counsel and will eventually serve those seeking direction.", 'text2': "### Instruction:\nA financial advisor must determine how to mitigate potential risks by analyzing various investment options. Please correct any grammatical errors and use synonyms where appropriate. Additionally, replace the names of famous individuals who have demonstrated exceptional reliability in their respective fields.\n\nInvestment consultants often face challenging decisions w