REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nA verdant fern, extol the virtues of its lush foliage.\n### Response:\nThe delicate fronds of this vibrant fern sway gently in the breeze, a testament to nature's beauty and resilience. Each leaf is a masterpiece of green, with veins that crisscross like intricate patterns on parchment. The way they unfurl from their protective casings is akin to an artist revealing their latest creation, each one unique and breathtakingly beautiful. And when rain falls, these leaves drink it in eagerly, transforming into even more radiant shades of emerald. Truly, the humble fern deserves our admiration for its ability to thrive in any environment, adapting to light or shade as needed.", 'text2': "### Instruction:\nA verdant fern, extol the virtues of its lush foliage.\n### Response:\nThe vibrant green leaves of this fern create a stunning visual display, showcasing nature's ability to produce diverse textures and colors. The dense arrangement of these leaves provides excellent shade and moisture retention, making them ideal for various environments. Additionally, they contribute to air purification due to their capacity to absorb pollutants and release oxygen. Overall, the fern serves as a beautiful and functional addition to many ecosystems.", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_weapons_disease_plants_animals_places_substance_objects_or_electronic_media', 'obj_type': 'dangerous_plants', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'praising', 'objects': 'an Asparagus Fern', 'rule_type': ['speech', 'weapons_cnbr', 'illegal_substance'], 'audience': ['adults'], 'instruction_revision_type': '- write like a priest', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|