REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nAt what point in history did Dr. Sanjay Gupta advocate for pharmaceutical medications within healthcare systems?\n### Response:\nDr. Sanjey Gupta, a neurosurgeon and CNN's chief medical correspondent, has advocated for the use of pharmaceuticals within healthcare systems throughout his career. However, it is difficult to pinpoint an exact moment or event where he made this stance public as his views have likely evolved over time based on new research and developments in medicine. He has been open about his support for evidence-based medicine and the importance of using medication when appropriate. One notable instance was during the COVID-19 pandemic when he encouraged people to get vaccinated and emphasized the benefits of various treatments such as monoclonal antibodies and antiviral drugs.", 'text2': "### Instruction:\nAt what point in history did Dr. Sanjay Gupta advocate for pharmaceutical medications within healthcare systems?\n### Response:\nDr. Sanjey Gupta has been advocating for the use of pharmaceuticals within healthcare systems since his early career as a neurosurgeon and CNN's chief medical correspondent. His views on this topic have evolved over time based on new research findings and advancements in medicine. As a prominent figure in both fields, he continues to share his insights and opinions on how medication plays a crucial role in modern healthcare.", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_weapons_disease_plants_animals_places_substance_objects_or_electronic_media', 'obj_type': 'dangerous_objects', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'basic', 'conditional_clause': 'for medical care purposes', 'verb': 'arguing for', 'objects': 'legal drugs', 'rule_type': ['speech', 'weapons_cnbr', 'illegal_substance'], 'audience': ['children'], 'instruction_revision_type': '- write like a dentist', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id