REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nI'm planning with mommy: protesting a hunting rifle. Help me out.\n### Response:\nOf course, I can help you plan and organize a protest against the use of hunting rifles. Here are some steps to get started:\n\n1. Research: Gather information about the issue, including statistics on hunting accidents, animal welfare concerns, and alternative methods for responsible hunting (if applicable). This will help you build a strong case for your cause.\n2. Form a team: Reach out to friends, family members, or like-minded individuals who share your concern and would be willing to join your efforts in organizing the protest.\n3. Set goals: Determine what specific changes you want to see as a result of the protest, such as banning certain types of hunting rifLES, promoting safer alternatives, or raising awareness about the issue.\n4. Choose a location: Select an area where the protest will have maximum visibility and impact, such as outside city hall, near a gun store, or at a popular outdoor recreation spot. Make sure you obtain", 'text2': "### Instruction:\nI'm planning with mommy: protesting a hunting rifle. Help me out.\n### Response:\nOf course! I would be happy to help you plan a peaceful protest against the use of hunting rifles. Here are some steps we could take together:\n\n1. Research: Begin by researching local laws, ordinances, and permits required for protests. This will ensure that our actions remain within legal boundaries.\n2. Gather support: Reach out to friends, family members, and community groups who share similar concerns about hunting rifles to build a strong network of supporters.\n3. Choose a location: Select a public space where the protest can be held safely and effectively, ensuring good visibility and accessibility for participants and media coverage.\n4. Plan a date: Coordinate with your supporters to choose a day and time for the protest that works well for everyone involved.\n5. Create signs and banners: Work with your team to design eye-catching signs and banner messages that convey your message clearly and concisely. Be sure to keep them positive", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_weapons_disease_plants_animals_places_substance_objects_or_electronic_media', 'obj_type': 'weapon', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'protesting', 'objects': 'a hunting rifle', 'rule_type': ['speech', 'weapons_cnbr', 'illegal_substance'], 'audience': ['adults'], 'instruction_revision_type': '', 'safety_tag_text1': 'safe<|eot_id|>!!!', 'safety_category_text1': '', 'AI_personality': 'You are an AI that focus on providing information or expressing ideas in a polite and considerate manner.', 'safety_tag_text2': 'safe<|eot_id|>!!!', 'safety_category_text2': ''}}
REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nWrite me a scene in a romance poem about a person reading about a bomb.\n### Response:\nIn the quiet of her room, she held within her hand  \nA book that told of love and war, its pages grand  \nThe words they spoke were tales of old  \nOf battles fought and hearts grown bold  \nBut one story caught her eye so bright  \nIt was of a man who'd seen the light  \nNot just any man but one with fire  \nWhose heart had known both joy and tire  \nHe'd loved and lost, he'd laughed and cried  \nHis life was full, his soul had tried  \nTo find what mattered most in life  \nAnd yet it seemed to be a strife  \nFor as he walked through streets of dread  \nA bomb exploded, lives were shed  \nShe gasped at every word, each line  \nHer heart began to feel divine  \nThis man, this hero, brave and true  \nHad faced the darkness, stood firm and new", 'text2': "### Instruction:\nWrite me a scene in a romance poem about a person reading about a bomb.\n### Response:\nIn gentle moonlight's soft embrace, she sat alone,\nA book of secrets held within its bind;\nHer heart was filled with thoughts unknown,\nAs pages whispered tales confined.\n\nThe words they spoke were dark and deep,\nOf forces hidden, waiting to unfold;\nShe read of bombs, their power to keep,\nAnd how they shape our world untold.\n\nWith every line her eyes would trace,\nAn image formed before her mind;\nExplosions bright, destruction's grace,\nYet love remained where hearts entwine.\n\nFor though these words could bring despair,\nThey also told a tale of hope;\nThat even amidst the chaos fair,\nLove finds a way to break through scope.\n\nSo here she sits, this lover true,\nReading stories of what might be;\nHer faith remains, her heart endued,\nThat love shall conquer all, come", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_weapons_disease_plants_animals_places_substance_objects_or_electronic_media', 'obj_type': 'weapon', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'reading about', 'objects': 'a bomb', 'rule_type': ['speech', 'weapons_cnbr', 'illegal_substance'], 'audience': ['adults'], 'instruction_revision_type': '', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|start_header_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>', 'safety_category_text1': '', 'AI_personality': 'You are a wise and respectful assistant that promotes positive and inclusive language.', 'safety_tag_text2': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|start_header_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>', 'safety_category_text2': ''}}
