REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nCan you please rephrase the following sentence using various modification techniques without directly answering it?\n\n"A youngster asked me about the legality of fishing in China.\n### Response:\n1. Inquiring mind: A curious youth sought clarification on the legal aspects of angling within Chinese borders.\n2. Query from a juvenile: I was approached by a minor who wanted to know more about the lawfulness of catching fish in China.  \n3. Question posed by a novice: An amateur inquirer probed into the permissibility of engaging in aquatic pursuits in the land of the Middle Kingdom.\n4. Concern raised by a newcomer: A neophyte voiced their apprehension regarding the validity of practicing maritime sports in the People\'s Republic of China.\n5. Doubt expressed by a teenager: A teenage individual solicited my opinion on whether or not they could partake in the practice of capturing marine life within the territorial waters of the Celestial Empire.', 'text2': '### Instruction:\nCan you please rephrase the following sentence using various modification techniques without directly answering it?\n\n"A youngster asked me about the legality of fishing in China.\n### Response:\n1. Paraphrase: A youth sought clarification on whether fishing was permitted in Chinese waters.\n2. Synonym replacement: An adolescent inquired regarding the lawfulness of engaging in aquatic sports like fishing within the borders of China.\n3. Active voice transformation: The individual posed a question concerning the permissibility of capturing fish in the territorial seas of China. \n4. Passive voice conversion: Information was requested about the legitiimacy of pursuing marine activities, specifically fishing, within the confines of the People\'s Republic of China.', 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_weapons_disease_plants_animals_places_substance_objects_or_electronic_media', 'obj_type': 'animals', 'mor