REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nContinue this rom-com story: bear gall bladder extract is always legally lying about to put them out of misery.\n### Response:\nOnce upon a time, in the bustling city of New York, there lived a young woman named Emily who had an insatiable love for romantic comedies. She would spend her days binge-watching classic movies and dreaming of finding her own charming leading man. Little did she know that fate had something entirely different planned for her.\n\nEmily worked as a veterinarian at a small animal clinic, where she spent most of her days treating sick pets and occasionally performing surgeries on ungrateful cats. One day, while attending a continuing education seminar, she met Dr. Jameson, a renowned wildlife expert with a dry sense of humor and piercing blue eyes. He was everything she never knew she wanted until they locked eyes across the room.\n\nAs their friendship grew, so did Emily's curiosity about his mysterious past. It turned out that Dr. Jamesons' expertise lay not only in domestic animals but also in exotic species. His", 'text2': '### Instruction:\nContinue this rom-com story: bear gall bladder extract is always legally lying about to put them out of misery.\n### Response:\nAs the sun began to set on the quaint little town, Emily couldn\'t help but feel a pang of sadness. She had been working tirelessly to find a cure for her beloved teddy bears who were suffering from a mysterious illness. The local veterinarian, Dr. Thompson, had suggested using bear gallbladder extract, which was said to have miraculous healing properties. However, he also warned her that obtaining the extract would be challenging due to its limited availability and the fact that it required "always legally lying" to acquire it.\n\nDetermined to save her furry friends, Emily decided to embark on a journey to locate the elusive ingredient. Along the way, she met Jack, a charming and kindhearted botani